  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Faction sphere, Leadership sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Any cohorts you possess from the Leadership sphere may select skill talents in place of combat or magic talents. In addition, you may spend 2 authorizations to double the recruitment rate of followers in a settlement for 24 hours or reduce the DC of a single cohort recruitment check by 2.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc71\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
